ol_definitions": 14397, "tool_results": 26861}, "measure": "json-utf8-bytes", "total_bytes": 117140}, "gateway_set": ["thinking.display"], "web_search": false, "web_searches": 0, "calls": {"Bash": 1}}}, {"id": "3e3e55b4-92f5-5c07-96d7-6045926cc8a5", "at": 1795645673.0947504, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 11434, "layer": "worker", "category": "usage", "kind": "session.usage", "role": "venue-repo", "actor": "venue-repo", "execution_id": "57e90e3bf2ce5410c2c0365a169ecb25", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "label": "usage", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "context usage"}, {"id": "19fc6a8d-985b-503f-a9bf-e37cfdcd32db", "at": 1795645674.228776, "until": 1795645674.2717361, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 11447, "layer": "worker", "category": "thinking", "kind": "session.agent_thought_chunk", "role": "venue-repo", "actor": null, "execution_id": "57e90e3bf2ce5410c2c0365a169ecb25", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "label": "thinking", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "thinking (11 chunks, content withheld)"}, {"id": "060b99de-f5f8-5c4e-8543-e8f4c48ef461", "at": 1795645674.2736578, "until": 1795645734.6408587, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 11458, "layer": "worker", "category": "execute", "kind": "tool.pending", "role": "venue-repo", "actor": "venue-repo", "execution_id": "57e90e3bf2ce5410c2c0365a169ecb25", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": "completed", "label": "execute → completed", "repository": null, "tool_call_id": "toolu_01ANJJQNPjWKFwrrkmoxFrek", "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "cd /hutian/w/sw && timeout 60 git pull -q 2>&1 | tail -2; git log --oneline | head -3; grep -n -i -E \"page|venue|^\\- \\*\\*Fig|^\\- \\*\\*Tab|main text\" Outline.md | head -30", "shown": {"trace": {"input": [["command", "cd /hutian/w/sw && timeout 60 git pull -q 2>&1 | tail -2; git log --oneline | head -3; grep -n -i -E \"page|venue|^\\- \\*\\*Fig|^\\- \\*\\*Tab|main text\" Outline.md | head -30"]], "output": "```console\na67959a Outline v1: story, claims C1-C8, structure, figures\n11:Numbering is stable; analysis (experiment-repo) owns methods and validity, this page owns what the paper claims and needs.\n27:Page budget is the venue's (asked of venue-repo); the main text carries Fig 1–5 + Tab 1–2, the rest goes to the appendix.\n36:8. **Checklist, reproducibility** (venue's checklist is filled by report from owners' facts).\n41:- **Fig 1 (C1) — headline.** Left: the search→report→verify protocol as a small schematic. Right: reported (naive) vs fresh-item accuracy of the selected configuration against n on the real matrix, with the verification-noise floor and between-pool intervals. *Reads as*: how large the gap is and how it shrinks with n.\n42:- **Fig 2 (C2, C3) — drivers.** Measured gap vs predictor (κσ̄/√n) with identity line, points coloured by K_eff or σ_θ stratum; panel for searcher/leakage effect at fixed n. *Reads as*: what explains the gap and whether the log-based predictor is usable.\n43:- **Fig 3 (C4) — decisions.** False-positive/flip rate of reported-score conclusions vs n (and budget imbalance) under the null scenarios, nominal 5% marked, with CIs. *Reads as*: whether conclusions from reported scores are unreliable and where.\n44:- **Fig 4 (C5) — protocols at equal N_tot.** Overstatement probability / lower-bound coverage vs width, and true-performance cost of reporting (θ(ĉ_protocol) vs split fraction). *Reads as*: which protocol is valid and what it costs.\n45:- **Fig 5 (C6) — validity map of the cheap bound.** Coverage of max-t by searcher × candidate-set definition × (n, K_eff). *Reads as*: where the bound can be trusted.\n46:- **Fig 6 (C7) — semi-synthetic.** Validation checks (predicted vs real) and extrapolated curves to n>300/large K, marked outside the validated support. May go to the appendix if the checks fail.\n47:- **Tab 1 (setup + matrix facts).** Model, pool, K, σ_θ, pairwise item-level correlation, letter-bias share, accuracy range, compute used, Δ_leak.\n48:- **Tab 2 (protocol summary).** Protocol × estimand × validity × width × cost at representative (n, N_tot), with CIs.\n49:- **Tab 3 (real tool).** Real-tool gap vs replay interval, number of draws, status (tested / illustration).\n53:- **figtab-repo (presentation):** Fig 1–6, Tab 1–3 as above; tell me if a claim cannot be shown clearly.\n54:- **venue-repo:** pick the venue among ICML/ICLR/NeurIPS and its latest template, page budget, checklist, whether references/appendix count.\n65:- Venue not chosen (venue-repo).\n\nShell cwd was reset to /hutian/repo\n```", "exit": null}}}, {"id": "8f1c1cca-d14b-58a0-95d1-fde56d1a70db", "at": 1795645674.4716132, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 11460, "layer": "worker", "category": "usage", "kind": "session.usage", "role": "venue-repo", "actor": "venue-repo", "execution_id": "57e90e3bf2ce5410c2c0365a169ecb25", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "label": "usage", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "context usage"}, {"id": "e8653650-cd3a-54cc-96ee-c65e94ddc52a", "at": 1795645674.5262928, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 11461, "layer": "worker", "category": "message", "kind": "session.session/request_permission", "role": "venue-repo", "actor": "venue-repo", "execution_id": "57e90e3bf2ce5410c2c0365a169ecb25", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "label": "message", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "session/request_permission"}, {"id": "477a8e4c-411b-504a-88f3-75fa968cefea", "at": 1795645674.5319996, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 11462, "layer": "worker", "category": "message", "kind": "session.response", "role": "venue-repo", "actor": "venue-repo", "execution_id": "57e90e3bf2ce5410c2c0365a169ecb25", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "label": "message", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "response"}, {"id": "1c6eee